{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 61, "text": "为\n社\n会\n党\n造\n成\n流\n血\n之\n地\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n•\n一\n四\n奧\n总\n代\n表\n任\n纳\n博\n士\n答\n复\n和\n会\n，\n说\n，\n「\n奧\n国\n今\n已\n坐\n食\n其\n较\n前\n大\n减\n之\n资\n本\n，\n若\n再\n加\n以\n摧\n残\n，\n必\n为\n社\n会\n党\n \n造\n成\n流\n血\n之\n地\n」\n，\n蠢\n哉\n任\n纳\n博\n士\n \n！\n你\n还\n不\n知\n道\n协\n约\n国\n一\n年\n以\n来\n之\n真\n目\n的\n，\n系\n专\n为\n造\n成\n社\n会\n党\n流\n血\n之\n地\n吗\no\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n为\n社\n会\n党\n造\n成\n流\n血\n之\n地\n五\n七\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e03dababa7dee1960fb661c16f4dd99822e163d2cb7bf7f5f657d9edd1631892", "text_chars": 280}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 62, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 63, "text": "德\n博\n士\n彭\n斯\n坦\n演\n说\n曰\n，\n「\n媾\n和\n条\n件\n，\n乃\n野\n蛮\n战\n争\n的\n结\n果\n，\n德\n国\n最\n宜\n负\n责\n。\n和\n约\n条\n件\n十\n九\n为\n必\n要\n的\n」\n。 \n我\n们\n固\n然\n反\n对\n协\n约\n国\n的\n强\n迫\n和\n约\n。\n但\n博\n士\n这\n话\n，\n系\n专\n对\n野\n蛮\n战\n争\n而\n发\n，\n听\n了\n倒\n狠\n爽\n快\n。\n◦\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n.\n七\n.\n一\n四\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "43349ca572bf0547a128e8270169e1eed02a7f81b4d2cd57a68cc10715ee679d", "text_chars": 203}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 64, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 65, "text": "各\n国\n没\n有\n明\n伦\n堂\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n康\n有\n为\n因\n为\n广\n州\n修\n马\n路\n，\n要\n拆\n毁\n明\n伦\n堂\n，\n动\n了\n肝\n火\n。\n打\n电\n给\n岑\n伍\n，\n斥\n为\n「\n侮\n圣\n灭\n伦\n。\n」\n说\n，\n「\n遍\n游\n \n各\n国\n，\n未\n之\n前\n闻\n。\n」\n康\n先\n生\n的\n话\n真\n不\n错\n，\n遍\n游\n各\n国\n，\n那\n里\n寻\n得\n出\n什\n么\n孔\n子\n。\n更\n寻\n不\n出\n什\n么\n明\n伦\n堂\n。\no\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n.\n七\n.\n一\n四\n各\n国\n没\n有\n明\n伦\n堂\n \n， \n六\n一\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e57568ed91829662155e17d0f66450f48085881e214ecedd960dd31e109e8fbb", "text_chars": 267}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 66, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 67, "text": "什\n么\n是\n民\n国\n所\n宜\n？\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n康\n先\n生\n又\n说\n，\n「\n强\n要\n拆\n毁\n，\n非\n民\n国\n所\n宜\n。\n」\n这\n才\n是\n怪\n！\n难\n道\n定\n要\n留\n着\n那\n「\n君\n为\n臣\n纲\n」「\n君\n君\n臣\n臣\n」\n \n的\n事\n，\n才\n算\n是\n「\n民\n国\n所\n宜\n」\n吗\n？\n〇\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n.\n七\n.\n一\n四\n什\n么\n是\n民\n国\n所\n宜\n？\n \n六\n三\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "95b1f4dda972922ddd90d06d20a772a2bb48cc690c68b4cf8bdb3460a3b156f9", "text_chars": 209}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 68, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 69, "text": "大\n略\n不\n是\n人\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n•\n \n一\n四\n邓\n溶\n在\n新\n国\n会\n云\n，\n「\n尊\n孔\n不\n必\n设\n专\n官\n，\n节\n者\n经\n费\n。\n」\n张\n元\n奇\n云\n，\n「\n内\n务\n部\n祀\n孔\n，\n由\n茶\n房\n录\n事\n办\n理\n， \n次\n长\n司\n长\n不\n理\n，\n要\n设\n专\n官\n。\n」\n内\n务\n部\n的\n茶\n房\n录\n事\n，\n大\n略\n不\n是\n人\n。\n要\n说\n是\n人\n，\n怎\n样\n连\n祀\n孔\n都\n不\n行\n呢\n？\n我\n \n想\n孔\n老\n爹\n的\n官\n气\n到\n了\n这\n么\n久\n的\n年\n载\n，\n量\n也\n减\n少\n了\n \n一\n点\n。\no\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n.\n七\n.\n一\n四\n大\n略\n不\n是\n人\n \n六\n五\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "dde7207926132600c568a4b06cdf052b0f835ab61693ddb91dbf8c79bb1ee14d", "text_chars": 311}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 70, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 71, "text": "走\n崑\n〗\n仑\n山\n到\n欧\n洲\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n卞\n一\n四\n张\n元\n奇\n又\n说\n，\n「\n什\n么\n讲\n求\n新\n学\n顺\n应\n潮\n流\n，\n本\n席\n以\n为\n应\n宗\n孔\n逆\n挽\n潮\n流\n。\n」\n不\n错\n不\n错\n！\n张\n先\n生\n果\n然\n有\n \n此\n力\n量\n，.\n那\n么\n，\n扬\n子\n江\n里\n的\n潮\n流\n，\n会\n从\n崑\n苍\n山\n翻\n过\n去\n。\n我\n们\n到\n欧\n洲\n的\n，\n就\n坐\n船\n走\n崑\n苍\n山\n罢\n。\no\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n走\n崑\nI\n仑\n山\n到\n欧\n洲\n \n六\n七\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "1cca5f9f7dc498dd8b7f637dc26cb8a15866f760454b7ffe9f61747eedcd9c4e", "text_chars": 259}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 72, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 73, "text": "好\n计\n策\n一\n九\n一\n九\n.\n七\n.\n一\n四\n一\n个\n学\n校\n的\n同\n学\n对\n我\n说\n，\n我\n们\n学\n校\n里\n办\n事\n人\n和\n教\n习\n，\n怕\n我\n们\n学\n到\n了\n他\n们\n还\n未\n学\n到\n的\n新\n学\n说\n，\n将\n图\n书\n \n室\n闭\n了\n。\n外\n面\n送\n来\n的\n杂\n志\n新\n闻\n纸\n和\n书\n籍\n，\n凡\n是\n稍\n新\n一\n点\n的\n，\n都\n没\n得\n见\n。\n我\n听\n了\n为\n之\n点\n首\n叹\n服\n。\n他\n们\n的\n计\n \n策\n真\n妙\n！\n岂\n仅\n某\n学\n校\n？\n通\n湖\n南\n的\n学\n校\n，\n千\n篇\n一\n律\n都\n像\n联\n了\n盟\n似\n的\n。 \no\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n好\n计\n策\n六\n九\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "311e524c77ba07da395f8e7061419c4e4e00ef192e66f94dc48ff3562b25bf88", "text_chars": 311}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 74, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 75, "text": "摇\n身\n一\n变\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n一\n些\n官\n僚\n式\n教\n育\n家\n，\n为\n世\n界\n的\n大\n潮\n卷\n□\n了\n，\n不\n提\n防\n就\n会\n将\n他\n们\n的\n饭\n碗\n冲\n破\n。\n摇\n身\n一\n变\n，\n把\n前\n日\n的\n烂\n \n调\n官\n腔\n，\n轻\n轻\n收\n拾\n。\n一\n些\n真\n有\n所\n感\n而\n改\n变\n的\n，\n很\n可\n佩\n服\n。\n一\n些\n则\n是\n假\n变\n，\n容\n易\n露\n出\n他\n们\n的\n马\n脚\n。\n这\n类\n人\n \n我\n狠\n为\n他\n羞\n！\n狠\n为\n他\n危\n！\n◦\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n.\n七\n• \n一\n四.\n摇\n身\n一\n变\n \n七\n一\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e629a47b0ddc87bcd14f6697ddbe92ddcee8764ec8bcb262617d96389c82faec", "text_chars": 282}
