{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 77, "text": "我\n们\n饿\n极\n了\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n.\n一\n四\n我\n们\n关\n在\n洞\n庭\n湖\n大\n门\n里\n的\n青\n年\n，\n实\n在\n是\n饿\n极\n了\n \n！\n我\n们\n的\n肚\n子\n固\n然\n是\n饿\n，\n我\n们\n的\n脑\n筋\n尤\n饿\n！\n替\n我\n \n们\n办\n理\n食\n物\n的\n厨\n师\n们\n，\n太\n没\n本\n钱\n。\n我\n们\n无\n法\n！\n我\n们\n惟\n有\n起\n而\n自\n办\n！\n这\n是\n我\n们\n饿\n极\n了\n的\n哀\n声\n！\n千\n万\n \n不\n要\n看\n错\n！\no\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n七\n• \n一\n四\n我\n们\n饿\n极\n了\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "b20ee30190ae8207112ac6086704a7f4988cb25889f14aad0eccd6bc8733a862", "text_chars": 259}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 78, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 79, "text": "难\n道\n走\n路\n是\n男\n子\n专\n有\n的\n一\n九\n一\n九\n•\n卞\n一\n四\n一\n个\n女\n学\n校\n里\n的\n办\n事\n人\n，\n把\n学\n生\n看\n做\n文\n契\n似\n的\n收\n藏\n起\n来\n，\n怕\n他\n们\n出\n外\n见\n识\n了\n什\n么\n邪\n样\n。\n新\n青\n年\n一\n类\n的\n \n邪\n扣\n，\n尤\n不\n准\n他\n们\n寓\n目\n。\n此\n次\n惊\n天\n动\n地\n的\n学\n生\n潮\n，\n北\n京\n的\n女\n学\n生\n聚\n诉\n新\n华\n门\n，\n贫\n儿\n院\n的\n小\n女\n孩\n子\n，\n愿\n到\n \n监\n狱\n替\n男\n学\n生\n抵\n罪\n。\n这\n个\n女\n学\n校\n的\n学\n生\n独\n深\n闭\n固\n拒\n，\n一\n步\n也\n不\n出\n外\n，\n好\n像\n走\n路\n是\n男\n子\n专\n有\n似\n的\n。\no\n湘\n江\n评\n论\n \n创\n刊\n号\n \n一\n九\n一\n九\n.\n七\n.\n一\n四\n难\n道\n走\n路\n是\n男\n子\n专\n有\n的\n \n七\n五\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-c0966a995bb82067c6e1", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-01.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "7db0eec5b88cfce1aa460bc3eadb94b6f984f2e477536f1c7ca3709f641b9e60", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 1, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "d3dc0f0f0e29490cf4256c2b294645eb661462882aa1e1fdaea3306f85225e3b", "text_chars": 366}
